/tmp
/target/
/.changeloop/*.db
/.changeloop/*.db-shm
/.changeloop/*.db-wal
**/node_modules/
**/test-results/
**/coverage/

# Python bytecode (skill scripts under .claude/skills/*/scripts/)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/docs/*
!/docs/roadmap.md
!/docs/threat-model.md
!/docs/migration-and-install-paths.md
!/docs/provider-replay-corpus.md
!/docs/quality-and-performance-baselines.md
!/docs/onboarding-and-updates.md
!/docs/extensions.md
!/docs/roadmap-traceability.md
!/docs/stability-and-deprecation.md
!/docs/database-recovery.md
!/docs/independent-review.md
!/docs/reports/
!/docs/reports/*.md
!/docs/adr/
!/docs/adr/*.md

# Astro/Starlight docs site build output. Source lives in website/docs/src;
# `website/docs/dist` is regenerated by the Pages workflow on every deploy.
# (The `/docs/*` rules above are anchored to the repo root and do not apply here.)
website/docs/dist/
website/docs/.astro/

# Serena MCP server (per-project config/cache/memories, auto-generated)
.serena/
solar-system/

# SQLite runtime artifacts (db + WAL + shared-memory)
dashboard/data/*.db
dashboard/data/*.db-shm
dashboard/data/*.db-wal

# Externally cloned scratch. It carries its own .git, so committing it would
# record a gitlink to a repository with no configured URL — broken for anyone
# who clones this one.
opencode/
